      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "An important part of patients with spinal cord disorder suffers chronic pain. Especially the neuropathic pain syndrome is a problem. The pain lost his function of a protective warning sign, it can reduce the quality of life dramatically. We show the diagnosis and pharmacotherapy in neuropathic pain syndromes in patients with spinal cord disorder."},
